  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3bf63731db4a78ffd773cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロマンの城に招待だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a65fa3edac051f0fc914de02212b406fa1d3bfa228be26bcf8949552ca9437c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d026da974d7cddc3b226fecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台さ、もっと派手に作ろうぜ！\r\nいっそ学園中をでっかい城にして…\r\nな、やっちまおうよ！　アハハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc319a042d85e5e91a8ce7cfad6ce2b97f106d9c45baf09b1a3b367f088a9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451cc5aeb93fa75eabcdb074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなことがあっても、\r\n仲間が集まりゃ解決できるさ！\r\nあとは本番、楽しむだけだな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "306e930bc21b8a11a57ccc8909360a9047758a2ef6839472edcddbfb5ae865bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817eec1836d25316a9bcc3bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、夢と踊ろうぜ！\r\n欲しいもん！溢れるロマン！望むがままに手に入れる！\r\nそれがアタシの生き様さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a39a48d3361cab4d9b52456fefa4e142d45a12ec2415abd0a43b9a1aae9102b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3cb48c3e578e833bc33a17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ踊ろう！　歌おう！\r\n円になって、肩を組んで！\r\n今を楽しもう、ただ“今”を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9d847e93f924cf371a490a479406030600906cd9468d5fc38dd8d4bd311740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc82b96aa7675f98e5df5e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Okay!宴の始まりだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc15a8e32be2d2c59e78bcdffa969d7b1634eef1737a28420463a3a18f64339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e7eb5a42419224920d4b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Come on!踊りまくるぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "425c1502b04bcdc1d4321fe83f87f0c2090b3d21516b7d97316a498a6fd61432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd6fb974d391dd9ebccd33b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "金も、ロマンも！全部アタシがいただく！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71c87fecc78525cf514a6117663703f6b703a4a89bf6ec4978e5d38d256eb7f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fea91446ae31eca046e6e44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "でっかい夢語り合って、大海原に\r\n漕ぎ出した日を覚えているかい？\r\nアタシについてきてよかっただろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fa43c0e4da6948e8e67922326712e2b2f712f24792c2a96b820a5701a874dd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76c45b16af029fd565284f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレセン学園の仲間の証、だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfbcbf5189a0b041349caf5710b9208c294fec40122634d54ee996f8bfc3220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812030bec219539d0c36e762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシのダンスを見ていきな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc865d88b32c66ee57d925910fc0961c148d01d74569061fe2caee98e39f418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224b5eaf23704d2225965588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、ロマンをこの手に掴むぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "638a9c2e2ea1f3efa72bd20d9c447b1899e2695e4ca379286b6df1683f832005",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda6c8db42cd337c60f2b271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これを着ているヤツは、\r\nみんな夢を追いかけているのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f2f23bae9e564cf781f8adb74f28099adf1970a6fd02f906237185d49b9dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c949834e8db44f857dda4de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "STARTING FUTURE…\r\n夢に向かって漕ぎ出す、ってか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307b652fec3f7ff08c2dd36be5bf94de3d4b4437f9bed1992e675775b566e25b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41469054944945e274957bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踊るように生きてやるのさ。\r\nこの勝負服で、な！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca3381e4823f8fa054296371300d498cc9eb3091adadd6c70d6682866b8f1a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0329a3c2a81e76f0abf26476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Okay、こんなのはどうだ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9761106f8f016e7098895537458c271f03ffce796be0349c3bd21b152638fe77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406f6ce3c5c4b7a274bfe113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何を着ても似合っちまうんだ！\r\nハッハッハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343d6e9b661a79c0012c1ebad697a1c29d80671475e188d5b327be8367483971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8277b1d8e252e2a5b1a3490",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレセン学園の仲間の証、だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfbcbf5189a0b041349caf5710b9208c294fec40122634d54ee996f8bfc3220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e6297ad1531789d69ea975f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシのダンスを見ていきな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc865d88b32c66ee57d925910fc0961c148d01d74569061fe2caee98e39f418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36813632a16da56a285028e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、ロマンをこの手に掴むぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "638a9c2e2ea1f3efa72bd20d9c447b1899e2695e4ca379286b6df1683f832005",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2daa5d0977a9e4a320ee3b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これを着ているヤツは、\r\nみんな夢を追いかけているのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f2f23bae9e564cf781f8adb74f28099adf1970a6fd02f906237185d49b9dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa2b969c632add5ce2879b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "STARTING FUTURE…\r\n夢に向かって漕ぎ出す、ってか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307b652fec3f7ff08c2dd36be5bf94de3d4b4437f9bed1992e675775b566e25b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abac2f520bf3d04e10ce3ad0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踊るように生きてやるのさ。\r\nこの勝負服で、な！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca3381e4823f8fa054296371300d498cc9eb3091adadd6c70d6682866b8f1a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
