      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40eb7a4eb1b87a899558c50a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Okay、こんなのはどうだ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9761106f8f016e7098895537458c271f03ffce796be0349c3bd21b152638fe77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028b0ac9542a58f2872c080f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何を着ても似合っちまうんだ！\r\nハッハッハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343d6e9b661a79c0012c1ebad697a1c29d80671475e188d5b327be8367483971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c681e30523f3b914cd6abca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3181597515bd99c427e2e5d9535c21703d36a6905a09b0083e8e3e3a2f7400e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f759bb0c03ecfd8fb1fd0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good morning!ご機嫌な朝に\r\n必要なことは？そう、期待だ！\r\n仲間とどんなことを話せるかってな",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46fdf8473b62b2976fc6eebafeecc90022d7f3407040f66eacde316c7dbf159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:785a3b635490d77ece98bdcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目が覚めないなら、1曲流して\r\n踊ってみな！冴えない朝が1日の\r\nオープニングに早変わりさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c237654fa5000075c32d9d60bb565dedfb2e043a082011ac1617d18d27951982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f327b9db9be0ce694929e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼はカフェテリアって決めてんだ。\r\nあそこなら山盛りの料理を仲間と\r\n囲んで騒げるからな！ハハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6265ff97ea378488abd7e7c3200acd6444bb91a3933faa68821a616f77b6e4ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a5abede56efc5fe42c777c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青い空の下、こんな日に仲間と\r\n宝探しに行けたら最高だって…\r\n想像してたら先生に注意されたよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6c26fc7c264d4bc504bc21021587dd44a51d669877151fc55f0dcbbfd13a77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96234d77765126632d9e24ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "疲れた顔してるな？もったいねぇと\r\n思っても、今日は早く休みな。\r\nその代わり、夢の中で騒ごうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab732fb0a4030c952e4503bfb6c7caf2461a044dc156d52d25bf05efc3ae6c36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3d62a7c1f787b87abd57d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "規則正しい生活ってのが大事なのは\r\nわかる…が！消灯時間が早すぎる！\r\nもうちょっと騒がせてくれよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "438502f47cf482ac685f935f74275bee922c622bb1e5d3e1076e0a60e28446c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ddd8da62eeaaf66b04d363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生歓迎会だろ、花見だろ、\r\nあとドロワにチーム歓迎会…\r\nいやぁ、宴だらけで最っ高だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3617caa6d20d50f3d4e28e3eaded95c850988e34aff850e600cd6dc17f46413c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0c3b2d9b7bf4269d254405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エースに頼んで、盆踊りを教えて\r\nもらったんだ！今度祭りにも連れて\r\n行ってくれるってさ！Awesome!",
      "source_fingerprint": "e336bbb3769f06dd343869f5e936d77037251abfc495456c6c3307b5535cbeba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38eb6e153fe1870320c858d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イチョウ並木を歩くのが好きでさ。\r\n金色でお宝の道みたいだろ。いつか\r\n本物の金であれの再現をするのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5d0221167df273774ffe06c3dc89165b2bb3a5973d317f8a193b05e0e9c37b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa897d5954a9c2772fcffb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本には、入ったら最後、誰も彼も\r\n眠って黙っちまう道具があんだろ？\r\n…KOTATSU、恐ろしい罠だ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c383d1e73c926f9a8bdde7a033a84f7a2543c0230beead51b0e36ee13c29c58a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed764f27148ffd9263052b93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0ec480eb1c205f2ee4177f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘリオスは最高のRoommateさ！\r\nミラーボールとDJ機材持ち込んで\r\nずっとバカ騒ぎしてくれんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce04c122f81c79bf27d460bcfd59fabd4d8334055b5cd483f0db888ba087128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7d2143b0bf4e8598d88e54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エースとスカジャンってやつを\r\n買いに行ったんだ！お揃いで着てさ\r\n最高にcoolな写真が撮れたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e5e7dfb6f17a19ce7e8637b1baf1a6d155a46cb9fdeb5b391da8a9a53a3dd9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e69438acaf73de39e97565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエスとは話している時より、\r\n踊っている時のほうが通じ合うね。\r\n情熱がビシビシぶつかってくるんだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "341c84ac115a72b6ec68b9ddc6dffa5e4a6bf530bddea31b3c3e524331400c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95a3348c709f4cc0293509c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アキュートの雰囲気、なんとなく\r\nうちのグランマに似てるんだよな…\r\n安心するってか、和むってか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeaee81be82af34949f6ed48f3da7693b3f8fe5d6759ffaa03cd309ae8ee26dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eca65f5f716d87607d3acad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシは1人っ子なんだけど、\r\n全く寂しくはないね。broやsis\r\nみたいなヤツらばっかだからかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3799e2337dcac0809783e5b418d3a06a32d9968a29d37d28f66ebdd6af7ea17f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d61ecbaf7964943b6d1963b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園に来て、まずもらった衣装が\r\nコレでさ。嬉しくて踊りまくって…\r\n汗のせいで翌日にはクリーニングさ",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b23ccf188f39ff797e15a2615372d56c23c0179c26ee4bf6a05f07f71538c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7877e06de673f2d5bbe51172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お揃いの衣装を着て、同じステージ\r\nで歌い踊る！ライブ中はさ、この\r\n時間よ、ずっと続けって思うんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae36214db865706381573b2c31224d8ac49d3dcd7497bcbcb67faafbc79b7d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1394c39483e5f21687c23f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踊るように生きて、欲しいもの\r\n全部掴む！そんなアタシの生き様を\r\nこの勝負服と共に刻んでやるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccd547f0e18c0ca5938e486d0083b684e7b20b3e12a231ed0ac4802ac80aa2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b61893baab0dbf51f76702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブでもこの衣装はよく映える\r\nんだ！ママの舞台衣装を参考に\r\nしたのさ。ダンサーっぽいだろ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af487a43fde100f33a5c2799e133af4376825e79a2a15dc1eb2c63935d33328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8b68ae8b1bf618034f7c68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘリオスはご機嫌な太陽さ！\r\n『おっはよー！』ってひと声で\r\n眠気もヒュンと逃げていくんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7310332f6688891c98cce97047d8b70c9b47c37b15de2a27ea0428f36c89341a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3148cef24172660549d301fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスンの先生とは\r\n個人的にもよく話すんだ。新しい\r\n振付けの感想を聞かれたりするよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f15617b157f1c950d6af3e991c5045a85bf572aaf577fcb08d138ad570707f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec5992541b07fb0b89c3807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニヴァースも夜空を見上げては、\r\n遥か遠くに想いを馳せてるんだと。\r\n…ロマンだよな、わかるぜ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9581911f4eecee77ac6b3f92e70ee6540307e10c139e5167a48e184925a75c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0e293c0f44bcf2d3bf9c3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ついつい料理を作りすぎるんだが、\r\nそういう時は全部弁当にするんだ！\r\nで、花見さ！宴し放題、最高だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b253490a436338ef011988637471a523aaca16cc2ed7fc44431ae3eb87ce4b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a576d0b027dfb32258c2650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつか…氷の城を購入して…\r\n夏はそこで宴を開いてやるんだ…！\r\nこの暑さは…それまでの辛抱…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96511ed765e787a1511b21220d7e52565839c9f975720eaa2eda47035e92dee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:650e65bc02eec3550e5d45d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロブロイと本の話で盛り上がってさ\r\n宝探しの冒険に、英雄と仲間の絆！\r\nアイツが語るロマンに胸が躍ったよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6190a67a4937f57624541cde82dcd965fa1d8028ed74b7ff042efea04aea5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42d152245ef47f2c7424018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの故郷じゃ、池が凍ったら\r\nみんなで滑りに行くんだ。近所の\r\nチビにも教えてさ…元気かな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81582d16c821073272f17be4c21751d6c699339a73805ff7d59113590b1b7954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9a2b4f322645a67ae9b71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、準備はできてる！\r\n今日もいいリズムを刻んでやるさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f2b901c54ddf67cbee172ea64cb9843ec3f7bec3c592e45c1636a7f17dea18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bd8b40bdf204798e43153a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ、やるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad35cf98bd75fa3f832aec08bfff509bdb7118639423c77ab04e496903b5d5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccc4e5d89bde9e95c374a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考える役目はアンタに任せる！\r\nアタシはただ、\r\n全力で思うがまま走るだけだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0692a89ce8b6b07cc2a30887bf6d6dc898eea426410274a12cc79303991dda56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b794f8b4a1c008522434fa30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、今日のトレーニングも\r\n楽しもうじゃないか！ここに2人が\r\n揃ったんだ、いい時間を過ごそうぜ",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b9e29ccb56f64357447454ab6dc11cf49affe65fff23a914d8ef285d268e74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441c632e45dd54ee75c19c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow、もう走っている奴らがいる\r\nじゃないか！乗り遅れるわけには\r\nいかないぞ、アタシたちも行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6571b4585552fcfff7956c63bea6ed77a7ece20a52014e5eda4d2314444a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cbe093fe9940601f81ea2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のアタシはツイているんだ。\r\n自販機のスロット、7が揃ってさ！\r\n1本やるよ、Happyのシェアだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e037fb176793b5df55a8ff33189a679d9c04d4e6afa799be9d78fcb46783291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ba8c7a799bc99e33fbd243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有名になってさ、スポンサーが\r\nついたらCM依頼とかもくるよな？\r\nそうしたら一緒に出ようぜ！ハハッ",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d686105081c7987f0d3574d7ec150db8a116dce9330b6ad28770f72af3bd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f62c65de5602fc57e2afa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界一の夢が叶ったら、次は何を\r\nしたい？何でも言ってみろよ、\r\nアンタの想像以上を見せてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb40d2a23867f46feda372027588444dea8a62aad5562af746a5737b2a44fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f65e89ed21d9862cf4d204e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくの合宿だ、もっとヒート\r\nアップしよう！太陽をステージ\r\nライトに、楽しもうじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bf13add9166ac663e968876e535ca2da1808445738685fc9dd13961d35b781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7675393a64b0093a9938c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからも一生、一緒にバカ騒ぎしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bc38e855f97d5c542fef9c55e98ebbdef7eec302426c4cbc4568e88f8567cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112bdaf615df5de6e810d576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシたちの旅路に…乾杯っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1919dae19ed0e262cb98b797be288056dc91a24ce846465e72c72be3d2157f9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1066d318643231c40adcf9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ステップに磨きがかかったぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad5b6e100ed41e7736893c3c1d8b4919793d808d478ebbb6d65d1c39bc4eb75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880061803b909ddef7eff4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと沸かせてやるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4747160de7d508b2e5aae367a0100c74d6091389baae0b8416ed61ccb4e5f63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e7a73d0221bdbd0249826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK、タップダンスシチーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ea81825173037a109932257fa73f91ad41753254b46bb1abc982f48afa9a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ca99248a5b729c639eaae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生終わらない宴で\r\nアンタも笑って暮らそうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac98dfd1f434a9e6ddfb1672eb0b436e958702a54185f05a12ed5f43928265b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5999069af89a01a963d30c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう一肌脱いでやるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8564667af31e9cf1749201b43b6bf66cde984abf3aa1102f1535ba3af19cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6740da3cb1cabcf19625c47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、リードされたいのは誰だ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a84000f4982cf6fc0e97258d86edc3003263c71e96f9d29d94b26fe6c93eff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f46b6c8e733280e754e405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――行くぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b634c90ec573c26f2178b0dfccba2781e89e83c241b070606c9bb70b37092829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317f53c78383f6e758248574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強に至る、その日まで。\r\n私が見えていなかった私を、\r\nたくさん教えてほしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "702e6cebea97654df9d1152428af59f0e26182a2502e42010685b92cee460487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c58d222475b747a1adf615a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97947257c9cc4d99fa74f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ad959e7d38bf0879fa29694e9dfb266be6347e47e6b87a96796c63131331ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11a60ba3c42e7b25eea1ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧とは、呼べなくても――\r\nそれでも進めばいい。\r\n…胸を張っていこうと思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e0aabd66fb044a1e6101840b3d1410e05b2fcd43ca5ec9cbfd7d40acac3586",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b59fd18a9dd672f3301668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………。\r\n…いや。今も\r\n君がいるなと、思っただけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47091ad4a5d0dc410522ef41ed6aaa3e0f593889a3592102cda88c9e71e0ed2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6f935a6b1f6c93aa70011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速さに優れた者、技巧に優れた者…\r\n一族に名を連ねる最強の中の最強が\r\n正月に決まる。羽根つき大会でな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c253d8ea06d12c4625a9f57981aa3559b51b384b1416507737c9dae8de91e92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acec417db119ee5b4d80adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコをくれた相手に大豆クッキー\r\nを渡している。豆類のビタミンEも\r\n摂取すると、より効果的なんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b955dc14e58cb3c87b5d0cb5471c5bebb16aaff7f12cd983eeced63923a8b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcfdcead0de451cb61acd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カカオ70％含有のチョコレートを\r\n用意した。苦味は強いが、\r\n抗酸化作用が高い。…お疲れ様。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e066c915bde15a2704666886330958c413a129d9e03f339b139b993375e1d284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97d13a3f6e5f24b10e09d4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短冊には、毎年一族の健康と\r\n安全を願っている。\r\n…それが叶えば、充分だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "178c0f9ee4c850ac4a3ed28eabe04623071b459a1de931ebddd6f4cd04098aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
